messages[9]{user,text}:
  user_1,[00:00] Hello? Umm... hi, is this Neha from Shield Life Services? I have a question about my health policy.
  user_2,[00:05] Hi Aditi, yes this is Neha. I can hear you. How can I help you today?
  user_1,[00:12] So, I noticed my policy is about to expire... I think it says 'Expired' soon? I'm a bit confused.
  user_2,[00:18] Yeah, let me check that. [typing] ... Okay, I see your policy number  HLP-2023-0456, it's set to expire on 30/09/2026.
  user_1,[00:30] Oh... okay. I was hoping maybe we could extend or renew?
  user_2,[00:35] Unfortunately, the current product line is being phased out, so we can't renew the exact same plan.
  user_1,[00:40] Ah, that's... disappointing. What are my options then?
  user_2,[00:45] We can look at alternative health plans that suit your needs. I can email you the details. Is that okay?
  user_1,[00:50] Yeah, fine. [sighs] Send me whatever you have.